{
  "$schema": "./schema/project-settings.schema.json",
  "description": "The catalog of project settings and how a settings document is validated and normalized. The catalog holds the allowed values: the type codes, the built-in appearance of every type, the colors, the icons, the date formats, the defaults, the length limits and the IANA time zone ids of the tz database (generated by tools/time-zones.cs). Each vector has a name, a settings document as a client sends it (any JSON value) and either the settings it normalizes to (expected) or every problem that refuses it (problems, in any order). Problem paths: $ is the root, .name a property whose name is ASCII letters, digits, _ and - (starting with an ASCII letter or _), ['name'] any other property, written in the canonical spelling of a known member or type code and as given otherwise.",
